{"id":"5c7f9132ab843c91","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-identity-type.md","title":"弱、强与很强多型相等的规则","display":"df-identity-type — 弱、强与很强多型相等的规则","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"11","label":"16-df-identity-type","aliases":["16-df-identity-type","Intensional identity type"],"display":"df-identity-type — 弱、强与很强多型相等的规则","depends_on":[],"review_status":"indexed-rule-packages-explicit","review_priority":"P2","review_note_id":"J07","review_date":"2026-10-20","source":"§11.4, pp. 680–681 (PDF 700–701); Proposition 11.4.8","review_scope":"Three syntactic equality packages and beta/eta; no intensional-J identification","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-identity-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-identity-type</span><span>Intensional identity type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-identity-type — 弱、强与很强多型相等的规则"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"review_status","html":"indexed-rule-packages-explicit"},{"key":"review_priority","html":"P2"},{"key":"review_note_id","html":"J07"},{"key":"review_date","html":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"source","html":"§11.4, pp. 680–681 (PDF 700–701); Proposition 11.4.8"},{"key":"review_scope","html":"Three syntactic equality packages and beta/eta; no intensional-J identification"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定有限表达式编码的双 sort 演算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span>，sort 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\">\\(\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\)</span>；它有变量、上下文转换、保持类型的捕获避免替换，以及判断等式的等价关系、合同与替换规则。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash M\\equiv N:C\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash M\\equiv N:C\\)</span> 表示判断等式，不表示一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eq}\">\\(\\mathsf{Eq}\\)</span> 项。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind}\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span> 是新变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,a:A,b:A\">\\(\\Gamma,a:A,b:A\\)</span> 之后的良构声明序列，不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta=[a/b,r_A(a)/z]\">\\(\\theta=[a/b,r_A(a)/z]\\)</span> 是对角替换，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[p/z]\">\\([p/z]\\)</span> 是保持其他变量的替换。分号只分隔声明段，不引入额外 sort。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_w,\\mathcal R_s,\\mathcal R_v\">\\(\\mathcal R_w,\\mathcal R_s,\\mathcal R_v\\)</span> 分别表示本原子列出的弱、强、很强规则包；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf E_{A,C}(d;a,b,p)\">\\(\\mathsf E_{A,C}(d;a,b,p)\\)</span> 是带有绑定分支 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 的消去表达式，其作用域由下面的规则确定。各公式是对良构实例的元语言规则模式。</li>\n<li>弱规则包中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C:\\mathsf{Type}\">\\(C:\\mathsf{Type}\\)</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>；强规则包中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C:\\mathsf{Type}\">\\(C:\\mathsf{Type}\\)</span> 可含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>；很强规则包中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C:s\">\\(C:s\\)</span> 可含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}\">\\(s\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}\\)</span>，且上下文允许 types 与 kinds 混合。各包均含形成、引入、对应消去以及两条转换规则；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=v\">\\(\\kappa=v\\)</span> 时本原子所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 模式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 均取空序列。转换规则的目标 sort、参数语境与自由变量限制由下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Target}_\\kappa(\\Delta,C,\\ell)\">\\(\\mathsf{Target}_\\kappa(\\Delta,C,\\ell)\\)</span> 定义；目标形成判断的实际语境由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TgtCtx}_\\kappa(\\Gamma,A,\\Delta)\">\\(\\mathsf{TgtCtx}_\\kappa(\\Gamma,A,\\Delta)\\)</span> 给出，弱包须在不含相等证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 的语境形成目标；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_\\kappa,\\mathcal H_\\kappa\">\\(\\mathcal B_\\kappa,\\mathcal H_\\kappa\\)</span> 是分别索引后的规则包。</li>\n<li>消去节点的完整有限树编码在下文给出，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf E\">\\(\\mathsf E\\)</span> 保留为其显示缩写。设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta=(y_i:D_i)_{i=1}^r\">\\(\\Delta=(y_i:D_i)_{i=1}^r\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec y=(y_1,\\ldots,y_r)\">\\(\\vec y=(y_1,\\ldots,y_r)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec D=(D_1,\\ldots,D_r)\">\\(\\vec D=(D_1,\\ldots,D_r)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,z,\\vec y\">\\(a,b,z,\\vec y\\)</span> 互异，列表内嵌入的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec y\">\\(\\vec y\\)</span> 按拼接展开。目标绑定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,\\vec y,z\">\\(a,b,\\vec y,z\\)</span>，对角分支绑定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,\\vec y\">\\(a,\\vec y\\)</span>；实际端点、参数项列和相等证明是节点中独立的自由子树。宿主演算的无限变量集记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec v,\\vec w\">\\(\\vec v,\\vec w\\)</span> 为互异变量的有限列表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,f\">\\(e,f\\)</span> 为有限表达式或其有限元组，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 为有限同时替换。对元组逐分量使用原始树的 FV、换名和替换。绑定记录的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_{\\mathrm b}\">\\(\\sim_{\\mathrm b}\\)</span> 只比较原始树的捕获避免换名，不使用判断等式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{eq},\\mathsf{eqrefl},\\mathsf{eqelim}\">\\(\\mathsf{eq},\\mathsf{eqrefl},\\mathsf{eqelim}\\)</span> 是互异且与其他构造子不相撞的保留标签。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Elim}_\\kappa\">\\(\\mathsf{Elim}_\\kappa\\)</span> 的输入含全部绑定记录，以下递归同时扩充原始树的 FV 和替换。末条对角替换式取本页规则中良型的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>，其自由变量属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)\\cup\\{a\\}\\cup\\operatorname{rng}\\vec y\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)\\cup\\{a\\}\\cup\\operatorname{rng}\\vec y\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 相等按下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{db}\">\\(\\operatorname{db}\\)</span> 编码定义，与判断等式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv\">\\(\\equiv\\)</span> 区分。宿主原始树的每个非变量节点呈现为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf N_c((\\vec v_j,e_j)_{j=1}^{m(c)})\">\\(\\mathsf N_c((\\vec v_j,e_j)_{j=1}^{m(c)})\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 是完整构造子标签，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(c)\">\\(m(c)\\)</span> 及每个子槽的绑定表属于给定语法签名；无绑定子槽取空表，元组取无绑定构造子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 是有限变量栈，新绑定的变量附加在末尾；嵌套重名读取最后一次出现。先在有限树上定义该编码，再按结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 取类；演算判断、FV、捕获避免替换及本页节点在这些类上读取。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Elim}\">\\(\\mathsf{Elim}\\)</span> 的目标与分支槽使用上一条列出的绑定表，其余槽无绑定。以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\equiv_\\alpha f\">\\(e\\equiv_\\alpha f\\)</span> 比较任意原始代表的编码；表达式之间的元理论等号表示结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 类相等，绝不表示判断等式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{db}_\\eta(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\langle0,|\\eta|-\\max\\{i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|\\eta|\\}\\mid\\eta_i=x\\}\\rangle&amp;x\\in\\operatorname{rng}\\eta,\\\\\n\\langle1,x\\rangle&amp;x\\notin\\operatorname{rng}\\eta,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{db}_\\eta\\bigl(\\mathsf N_c((\\vec v_j,e_j)_{j=1}^{m(c)})\\bigr)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\left\\langle2,c,\n\\bigl(|\\vec v_j|,\\operatorname{db}_{\\eta\\mathbin{+\\!+}\\vec v_j}(e_j)\\bigr)_{j=1}^{m(c)}\\right\\rangle,\\\\\ne\\equiv_\\alpha f&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{db}_{()}(e)=\\operatorname{db}_{()}(f).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{db}_\\eta(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\langle0,|\\eta|-\\max\\{i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|\\eta|\\}\\mid\\eta_i=x\\}\\rangle&amp;x\\in\\operatorname{rng}\\eta,\\\\\n\\langle1,x\\rangle&amp;x\\notin\\operatorname{rng}\\eta,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{db}_\\eta\\bigl(\\mathsf N_c((\\vec v_j,e_j)_{j=1}^{m(c)})\\bigr)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\left\\langle2,c,\n\\bigl(|\\vec v_j|,\\operatorname{db}_{\\eta\\mathbin{+\\!+}\\vec v_j}(e_j)\\bigr)_{j=1}^{m(c)}\\right\\rangle,\\\\\ne\\equiv_\\alpha f&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{db}_{()}(e)=\\operatorname{db}_{()}(f).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Eq}_A(M,N)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathsf{eq},A,M,N\\rangle,\\qquad\nr_A(M)\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathsf{eqrefl},A,M\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf{Eq}_A(M,N))&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(r_A(M))&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(M),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Eq}_A(M,N)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Eq}_{A[\\sigma]}(M[\\sigma],N[\\sigma]),\\qquad\nr_A(M)[\\sigma]\\coloneqq r_{A[\\sigma]}(M[\\sigma]),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(e_1,\\ldots,e_n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=1}^n\\operatorname{FV}(e_i),\\qquad\n(e_1,\\ldots,e_n)[\\sigma]\\coloneqq(e_1[\\sigma],\\ldots,e_n[\\sigma]),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma}\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma(x)),\\\\\n(\\vec v,e)\\sim_{\\mathrm b}(\\vec w,f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n|\\vec v|=|\\vec w|\\land\\operatorname{db}_{\\vec v}(e)=\\operatorname{db}_{\\vec w}(f),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Abs}(\\vec v;e)&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\vec v,e)]_{\\sim_{\\mathrm b}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf{Abs}(\\vec v;e))&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(e)\\setminus\\operatorname{rng}\\vec v,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Abs}(\\vec v;e)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Abs}(\\vec v;e[\\sigma])\n\\quad\\bigl(\\operatorname{rng}\\vec v\\cap(\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma))=\\varnothing\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Eq}_A(M,N)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathsf{eq},A,M,N\\rangle,\\qquad\nr_A(M)\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathsf{eqrefl},A,M\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf{Eq}_A(M,N))&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(r_A(M))&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(M),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Eq}_A(M,N)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Eq}_{A[\\sigma]}(M[\\sigma],N[\\sigma]),\\qquad\nr_A(M)[\\sigma]\\coloneqq r_{A[\\sigma]}(M[\\sigma]),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(e_1,\\ldots,e_n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=1}^n\\operatorname{FV}(e_i),\\qquad\n(e_1,\\ldots,e_n)[\\sigma]\\coloneqq(e_1[\\sigma],\\ldots,e_n[\\sigma]),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma}\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma(x)),\\\\\n(\\vec v,e)\\sim_{\\mathrm b}(\\vec w,f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n|\\vec v|=|\\vec w|\\land\\operatorname{db}_{\\vec v}(e)=\\operatorname{db}_{\\vec w}(f),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Abs}(\\vec v;e)&amp;\\coloneqq[(\\vec v,e)]_{\\sim_{\\mathrm b}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf{Abs}(\\vec v;e))&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(e)\\setminus\\operatorname{rng}\\vec v,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Abs}(\\vec v;e)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Abs}(\\vec v;e[\\sigma])\n\\quad\\bigl(\\operatorname{rng}\\vec v\\cap(\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma))=\\varnothing\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\forall H\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(V))\n(\\exists(\\vec w,f)\\in[(\\vec v,e)]_{\\sim_{\\mathrm b}})\\quad\n\\operatorname{rng}\\vec w\\cap H=\\varnothing,\\\\\n&amp;(\\vec v,e)\\sim_{\\mathrm b}(\\vec w,f)\\land\n(\\operatorname{rng}\\vec v\\cup\\operatorname{rng}\\vec w)\n\\cap(\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma))=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}\\Longrightarrow\n(\\vec v,e[\\sigma])\\sim_{\\mathrm b}(\\vec w,f[\\sigma]).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\forall H\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(V))\n(\\exists(\\vec w,f)\\in[(\\vec v,e)]_{\\sim_{\\mathrm b}})\\quad\n\\operatorname{rng}\\vec w\\cap H=\\varnothing,\\\\\n&amp;(\\vec v,e)\\sim_{\\mathrm b}(\\vec w,f)\\land\n(\\operatorname{rng}\\vec v\\cup\\operatorname{rng}\\vec w)\n\\cap(\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma))=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}\\Longrightarrow\n(\\vec v,e[\\sigma])\\sim_{\\mathrm b}(\\vec w,f[\\sigma]).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Elim}_\\kappa(A,\\mathfrak m,\\mathfrak d;u,v,\\vec t,p)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathsf{eqelim},\\kappa,A,\\mathfrak m,\\mathfrak d,u,v,\\vec t,p\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf E_{A,C}(d;u,v,p)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{Elim}_\\kappa\\bigl(A,\n\\mathsf{Abs}((a,b,\\vec y,z);(\\vec D,C)),\n\\mathsf{Abs}((a,\\vec y);(\\vec D[a/b],d));u,v,\\vec y,p\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf{Elim}_\\kappa(A,\\mathfrak m,\\mathfrak d;u,v,\\vec t,p))\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathfrak m)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathfrak d)\n\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(u,v,\\vec t,p),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Elim}_\\kappa(A,\\mathfrak m,\\mathfrak d;u,v,\\vec t,p)[\\sigma]\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Elim}_\\kappa\n(A[\\sigma],\\mathfrak m[\\sigma],\\mathfrak d[\\sigma];u[\\sigma],v[\\sigma],\\vec t[\\sigma],p[\\sigma]),\\\\\n\\mathsf E_{A,C}(d;a,b,z)\\theta\n&amp;=\\mathsf E_{A,C}(d;a,a,r_A(a)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Elim}_\\kappa(A,\\mathfrak m,\\mathfrak d;u,v,\\vec t,p)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathsf{eqelim},\\kappa,A,\\mathfrak m,\\mathfrak d,u,v,\\vec t,p\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf E_{A,C}(d;u,v,p)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{Elim}_\\kappa\\bigl(A,\n\\mathsf{Abs}((a,b,\\vec y,z);(\\vec D,C)),\n\\mathsf{Abs}((a,\\vec y);(\\vec D[a/b],d));u,v,\\vec y,p\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf{Elim}_\\kappa(A,\\mathfrak m,\\mathfrak d;u,v,\\vec t,p))\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathfrak m)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathfrak d)\n\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(u,v,\\vec t,p),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Elim}_\\kappa(A,\\mathfrak m,\\mathfrak d;u,v,\\vec t,p)[\\sigma]\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Elim}_\\kappa\n(A[\\sigma],\\mathfrak m[\\sigma],\\mathfrak d[\\sigma];u[\\sigma],v[\\sigma],\\vec t[\\sigma],p[\\sigma]),\\\\\n\\mathsf E_{A,C}(d;a,b,z)\\theta\n&amp;=\\mathsf E_{A,C}(d;a,a,r_A(a)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_0\\coloneqq\\left\\{\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash N:A}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{Eq}_A(M,N):\\mathsf{Type}},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash M:A}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash r_A(M):\\mathsf{Eq}_A(M,M)}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R_0\\coloneqq\\left\\{\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash N:A}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{Eq}_A(M,N):\\mathsf{Type}},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash M:A}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash r_A(M):\\mathsf{Eq}_A(M,M)}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_w\\coloneqq\\left\\{\n\\frac{\\Gamma,a:A,b:A;\\Delta\\vdash C:\\mathsf{Type}\\quad\n\\Gamma,a:A;\\Delta[a/b]\\vdash d:C[a/b]}\n{\\Gamma,a:A,b:A;\\Delta,z:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)\\vdash\n\\mathsf E_{A,C}(d;a,b,z):C}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal E_w\\coloneqq\\left\\{\n\\frac{\\Gamma,a:A,b:A;\\Delta\\vdash C:\\mathsf{Type}\\quad\n\\Gamma,a:A;\\Delta[a/b]\\vdash d:C[a/b]}\n{\\Gamma,a:A,b:A;\\Delta,z:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)\\vdash\n\\mathsf E_{A,C}(d;a,b,z):C}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_s\\coloneqq\\left\\{\n\\frac{\\Gamma,a:A,b:A;\\Delta,z:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)\\vdash C:\\mathsf{Type}\\quad\n\\Gamma,a:A;\\Delta[a/b]\\vdash d:C\\theta}\n{\\Gamma,a:A,b:A;\\Delta,z:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)\\vdash\n\\mathsf E_{A,C}(d;a,b,z):C}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal E_s\\coloneqq\\left\\{\n\\frac{\\Gamma,a:A,b:A;\\Delta,z:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)\\vdash C:\\mathsf{Type}\\quad\n\\Gamma,a:A;\\Delta[a/b]\\vdash d:C\\theta}\n{\\Gamma,a:A,b:A;\\Delta,z:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)\\vdash\n\\mathsf E_{A,C}(d;a,b,z):C}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_v\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{s\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}}\\left\\{\n\\frac{\\Gamma,a:A,b:A,z:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)\\vdash C:s\\quad\n\\Gamma,a:A\\vdash d:C\\theta}\n{\\Gamma,a:A,b:A,z:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)\\vdash\n\\mathsf E_{A,C}(d;a,b,z):C}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal E_v\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{s\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}}\\left\\{\n\\frac{\\Gamma,a:A,b:A,z:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)\\vdash C:s\\quad\n\\Gamma,a:A\\vdash d:C\\theta}\n{\\Gamma,a:A,b:A,z:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)\\vdash\n\\mathsf E_{A,C}(d;a,b,z):C}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Target}_\\kappa(\\Delta,C,\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\kappa\\in\\{w,s\\}\\land\\ell=\\mathsf{Type}\\bigr)\n\\lor\\bigl(\\kappa=v\\land\\Delta=()\\land\\ell\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr]\n\\land\\bigl(\\kappa=w\\Rightarrow z\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(C)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Target}_\\kappa(\\Delta,C,\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\kappa\\in\\{w,s\\}\\land\\ell=\\mathsf{Type}\\bigr)\n\\lor\\bigl(\\kappa=v\\land\\Delta=()\\land\\ell\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr]\n\\land\\bigl(\\kappa=w\\Rightarrow z\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(C)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TgtCtx}_\\kappa(\\Gamma,A,\\Delta)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\Gamma,a:A,b:A;\\Delta&amp;\\kappa=w,\\\\\n\\Gamma,a:A,b:A;\\Delta,z:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)&amp;\\kappa\\in\\{s,v\\}.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TgtCtx}_\\kappa(\\Gamma,A,\\Delta)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\Gamma,a:A,b:A;\\Delta&amp;\\kappa=w,\\\\\n\\Gamma,a:A,b:A;\\Delta,z:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)&amp;\\kappa\\in\\{s,v\\}.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_\\kappa\\coloneqq\\left\\{\n\\frac{\\mathsf{TgtCtx}_\\kappa(\\Gamma,A,\\Delta)\\vdash C:\\ell\\quad\n\\Gamma,a:A;\\Delta[a/b]\\vdash d:C\\theta}\n{\\Gamma,a:A;\\Delta[a/b]\\vdash\n\\mathsf E_{A,C}(d;a,a,r_A(a))\\equiv d:C\\theta}\n\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathsf{Target}_\\kappa(\\Delta,C,\\ell)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal B_\\kappa\\coloneqq\\left\\{\n\\frac{\\mathsf{TgtCtx}_\\kappa(\\Gamma,A,\\Delta)\\vdash C:\\ell\\quad\n\\Gamma,a:A;\\Delta[a/b]\\vdash d:C\\theta}\n{\\Gamma,a:A;\\Delta[a/b]\\vdash\n\\mathsf E_{A,C}(d;a,a,r_A(a))\\equiv d:C\\theta}\n\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathsf{Target}_\\kappa(\\Delta,C,\\ell)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_\\kappa\\coloneqq\\left\\{\n\\frac{\\mathsf{TgtCtx}_\\kappa(\\Gamma,A,\\Delta)\\vdash C:\\ell\\quad\n\\Gamma,a:A,b:A;\\Delta,z:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)\\vdash Q:C}\n{\\Gamma,a:A,b:A;\\Delta,z:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)\\vdash\n\\mathsf E_{A,C}(Q\\theta;a,b,z)\\equiv Q:C}\n\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathsf{Target}_\\kappa(\\Delta,C,\\ell)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal H_\\kappa\\coloneqq\\left\\{\n\\frac{\\mathsf{TgtCtx}_\\kappa(\\Gamma,A,\\Delta)\\vdash C:\\ell\\quad\n\\Gamma,a:A,b:A;\\Delta,z:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)\\vdash Q:C}\n{\\Gamma,a:A,b:A;\\Delta,z:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)\\vdash\n\\mathsf E_{A,C}(Q\\theta;a,b,z)\\equiv Q:C}\n\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathsf{Target}_\\kappa(\\Delta,C,\\ell)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_\\kappa\\coloneqq\\mathcal R_0\\cup\\mathcal E_\\kappa\\cup\\mathcal B_\\kappa\\cup\\mathcal H_\\kappa\n\\quad(\\kappa\\in\\{w,s,v\\}),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Id}_A(M,N)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Eq}_A(M,N),\\quad\n\\mathrm{refl}_A(M)\\coloneqq r_A(M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R_\\kappa\\coloneqq\\mathcal R_0\\cup\\mathcal E_\\kappa\\cup\\mathcal B_\\kappa\\cup\\mathcal H_\\kappa\n\\quad(\\kappa\\in\\{w,s,v\\}),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Id}_A(M,N)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Eq}_A(M,N),\\quad\n\\mathrm{refl}_A(M)\\coloneqq r_A(M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{db}\">\\(\\operatorname{db}\\)</span> 保留构造子标签和自由变量名，把绑定变量转换为距最近声明的位置，所以结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 相等及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_{\\mathrm b}\">\\(\\sim_{\\mathrm b}\\)</span> 都由确定编码的相等给出。无限变量池为任意有限禁用集合提供新鲜绑定代表；对树归纳，捕获避免替换保持该编码相等，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Abs}[\\sigma]\">\\(\\mathsf{Abs}[\\sigma]\\)</span> 不依赖新鲜代表及内部绑定换名的选择。对角替换只改变消去节点的实际端点和证明；目标、分支中已绑定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b,z\">\\(b,z\\)</span> 保留为绑定位置。这给出正文的对角计算，并保留原三个规则包的全部条件。</li>\n<li>弱包的目标必须在不含相等证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 的语境中良型；仅知 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(C)\">\\(z\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(C)\\)</span>，不能在任意宿主演算中推出删除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 后的形成判断。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TgtCtx}\">\\(\\mathsf{TgtCtx}\\)</span> 将这个条件与消去规则保持一致，强包及很强包仍使用含证明的语境。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 不能只检查对角分支 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:C\\theta\">\\(d:C\\theta\\)</span>，还须先有非对角上下文中的合法目标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C:s\">\\(C:s\\)</span>；否则一个仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=b\">\\(a=b\\)</span> 后合法的原始表达式也会被错误当作消去目标。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 同样显式保留该形成前提。这是原书转换在良型消去实例中的展开，不增加新的相等强度。</li>\n<li>来源：§11.4，pp. 680–681（PDF 700–701）。书中写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\ \\mathrm{with}\\ b=a\\ \\mathrm{via}\\ p\">\\(Q\\ \\mathrm{with}\\ b=a\\ \\mathrm{via}\\ p\\)</span>；这里用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf E_{A,C}(Q;a,b,p)\">\\(\\mathsf E_{A,C}(Q;a,b,p)\\)</span> 编码同一个绑定构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_\\kappa,\\mathcal H_\\kappa\">\\(\\mathcal B_\\kappa,\\mathcal H_\\kappa\\)</span> 分别是原书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta,\\eta\">\\(\\beta,\\eta\\)</span> 转换；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 的任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 版本由显示的变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 版本作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[p/z]\">\\([p/z]\\)</span> 替换取得。很强包中取空 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span>；弱包中取不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>。有额外声明时可先把它们作为外层参数，或使用演算已有的替换、弱化规则。</li>\n<li>这次把原先另加的 intensional <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 与单独 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 草稿，改为本书的三种相等包。很强相等允许消去到 kind；只有这种强度才具有 Proposition 11.4.8 的 equality reflection 与相等证明转换唯一性。弱或强包不能凭 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 的引入规则取得 equality reflection。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Id}\">\\(\\mathrm{Id}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{refl}\">\\(\\mathrm{refl}\\)</span> 只保留为明确的历史拼写；本原子没有引入现代 intensional identity type 或同伦路径语义。原 aliases 中的 “Intensional identity type” 是历史检索名，不是现行数学断言。</li>\n<li>一层理解范畴中的相等见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3791ea7b3d0077ae\" href=\"?note=3791ea7b3d0077ae\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-equality\">16-df-comprehension-equality</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ec6ba39693a55895\" href=\"?note=ec6ba39693a55895\" title=\"16-df-strong-equality\">16-df-strong-equality</a>；两层的相对强度见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"63e260cd8847a6b6\" href=\"?note=63e260cd8847a6b6\" title=\"16-df-identity-relative-equality\">16-df-identity-relative-equality</a>。三种规则包之间的模型对应仍须逐包验证，不能把任意一个包自动指定为任意理解范畴的相等。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-comprehension-equality","status":"resolved","id":"3791ea7b3d0077ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"一层理解范畴中的相等见 [[16-df-comprehension-equality]]、[[16-df-strong-equality]]；两层的相对强度见 [[16-df-identity-relative-equality]]。三种规则包之间的模型对应仍须逐包验证，不能把任意一个包自动指定为任意理解范畴的相等。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-strong-equality","status":"resolved","id":"ec6ba39693a55895","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"一层理解范畴中的相等见 [[16-df-comprehension-equality]]、[[16-df-strong-equality]]；两层的相对强度见 [[16-df-identity-relative-equality]]。三种规则包之间的模型对应仍须逐包验证，不能把任意一个包自动指定为任意理解范畴的相等。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-identity-relative-equality","status":"resolved","id":"63e260cd8847a6b6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"一层理解范畴中的相等见 [[16-df-comprehension-equality]]、[[16-df-strong-equality]]；两层的相对强度见 [[16-df-identity-relative-equality]]。三种规则包之间的模型对应仍须逐包验证，不能把任意一个包自动指定为任意理解范畴的相等。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash M\\equiv N:C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Eq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind}","display":false},{"tex":"a,b","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,a:A,b:A","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":