":"\\mathcal R_\\kappa\\coloneqq\\mathcal R_0\\cup\\mathcal E_\\kappa\\cup\\mathcal B_\\kappa\\cup\\mathcal H_\\kappa\n\\quad(\\kappa\\in\\{w,s,v\\}),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Id}_A(M,N)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Eq}_A(M,N),\\quad\n\\mathrm{refl}_A(M)\\coloneqq r_A(M).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{db}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\sim_{\\mathrm b}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Abs}[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"b,z","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"z\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(C)","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{TgtCtx}","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"d:C\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"C:s","display":false},{"tex":"a=b","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\ \\mathrm{with}\\ b=a\\ \\mathrm{via}\\ p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf E_{A,C}(Q;a,b,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_\\kappa,\\mathcal H_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta,\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"[p/z]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Id}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{refl}","display":false}],"bytes":12076,"backlinks":[{"id":"ca2d757f82798122","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本原子给出形成接口；与项、结构和转换规则合起来的有限推导演算在 [[16-df-fhodtt-terms]] 定义。可选的多型相等扩展应明确选择 [[16-df-identity-type]] 的规则包，不能以 $r$ 引入冒充 equality reflection。与本页规则匹配的严格结构及其可靠性、完备性采用 [[16-df-split-fhodtt-structure]] 和 [[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]]；普通非分裂模型的相干选择不在该严格版本定理的量词中。"},{"id":"c921a3191bc6f9f0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"多型相等是另选规则包的扩展，见 [[16-df-identity-type]]；$r$ 的引入不是 equality reflection。"},{"id":"687f6bb462487d36","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind}$，$\\Gamma\\vdash M,N:A$。$\\mathsf{Eq}_A$、$r_A$ 以及所选弱、强或很强规则包来自 [[16-df-identity-type]]。"},{"id":"fc33254b6c0f298f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[16-df-identity-type]] 的弱、强或很强相等包；$\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind}$，$\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash P(x):\\mathsf{Type}$，$\\Gamma\\vdash a,b:A$，$\\Gamma\\vdash q:\\mathsf{Eq}_A(a,b)$，$\\Gamma\\vdash d:P(a)$。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-dtt-signature]]、[[16-df-split-dtt-structure]]、[[16-df-dtt-model]]、[[16-df-dtt-model-morphism]]、[[16-df-term-model]]、[[16-thm-term-model-initial]]、[[16-df-dtt-internal-language]]、[[16-thm-internal-language]]、[[16-thm-dtt-completeness]]、[[16-df-identity-type]]、[[16-df-identity-relative-equality]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-terms]]、[[16-df-split-fhodtt-structure]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]]、[[16-thm-fhodtt-soundness]]、[[16-thm-fhodtt-completeness]]、[[16-prop-fhodtt-kind-reflection]]。DTT 结果使用明确的强片段与严格态射；FHoDTT 的可靠性和完备性使用匹配其语法的两 sort 严格模型。内部语言评价是否覆盖整个模型，由语境生成条件判定。"},{"id":"4ba8845a1d7f7c05","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"固定 [[16-df-identity-type]] 中一个规则包 $\\mathcal R_\\kappa$ 及包含它的演算 $\\mathcal T$；表达式为有限编码，判断等式有等价、合同与替换规则。"}],"outgoing":["3791ea7b3d0077ae","ec6ba39693a55895","63e260cd8847a6b6"]}